==English==

===Etymology===
The verb is from {{etyl|non|en}} {{m|non|skvala||to cry out}}. The noun is probably from the verb.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|ɔːl|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|meteorology}} A [[squall line]], multicell line, or part of a squall line.
# {{lb|en|often|nautical}} A sudden [[storm]], as found in a squall line.

